  "source": "# The corridor of three doors\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/scene-four-doors.md`, then edited by it without its\n  grid (`game-three-doors-nogrid.md`).\n- What it left black along the top and in the bottom corners painted by Gemini\n  from `game-three-doors-voids.md`, joined by `tools/art/repaint.py`, and\n  what still was black tiled from the picture's own stones (`tiled`).\n- Its three walls moved along their rows by `tools/art/repaint.py spaced`, so\n  that the doors lie exactly four cells apart.\n- Each door opened by `tools/art/door.py` from the painting itself, no model asked.\n",
